1. The frontend still has `useGoals.ts` and `goals.ts` files
2. The `EchoConversation.tsx` is still importing and using `useActiveGoals` from `useGoals`
3. The frontend types file still has `ContentGoal`, `GoalStatus`, `GoalType` types

This will cause runtime errors when the frontend tries to call the removed `/api/v1/content-engine/goals/` endpoint.

